Third-party software that xclean-maps uses
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

gsplat 1.4.0
  Copyright the gsplat authors (nerfstudio-project, <https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat>).
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  xclean-maps calls gsplat's rasterizer (gsplat.rasterization) and its MCMC densification strategy
  (gsplat.strategy.MCMCStrategy and gsplat.strategy.ops). xclean-maps contains no gsplat source code, except a small
  PyTorch port of one gsplat CUDA kernel that only the CPU unit tests use (src/xclean_maps/mcmc_wrap.py,
  compute_relocation_torch, a port of gsplat/cuda/csrc/compute_relocation.cu).
  The Windows gsplat wheel in this repository (wheels/gsplat-1.4.0-cp312-cp312-win_amd64.whl) is an UNMODIFIED build
  of gsplat 1.4.0 (sources: the gsplat 1.4.0 files on PyPI; see wheels/GSPLAT_WHEEL_BUILD_RECORD.md), compiled for
  Python 3.12, PyTorch 2.9.1 and CUDA 13.0. It is distributed under gsplat's own Apache-2.0 licence, with gsplat's
  LICENSE file inside the wheel.

GLM (OpenGL Mathematics), bundled inside gsplat (gsplat/cuda/csrc/third_party/glm)
  Copyright (c) 2005 - G-Truc Creation. Licensed under the MIT License (see glm's copying.txt inside gsplat).

xclean (import name xclean; distribution xstereo-slam)
  Copyright 2026 Necessity Robotics, India. Apache License, Version 2.0. xclean-maps reads sequences with xclean's
  reader and computes depth with xclean's 32-direction SGM (xclean/stereo/sgm32.py). See xclean's own NOTICE.

three.js r186 (src/xclean_maps/web/vendor/three: three.module.js, three.core.js, OrbitControls.js, Pass.js)
  Copyright 2010-2026 three.js authors. MIT License (src/xclean_maps/web/vendor/three/LICENSE). Used unmodified by the
  browser viewer.

Spark (src/xclean_maps/web/vendor/spark/spark.module.js), Copyright 2025 World Labs Technologies, Inc.
  MIT License (src/xclean_maps/web/vendor/spark/LICENSE); it bundles fflate (MIT,
  src/xclean_maps/web/vendor/spark/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSE_fflate). Used unmodified by the browser viewer.

PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), SciPy (BSD-3-Clause), OpenCV / opencv-contrib-python (Apache-2.0), CuPy (MIT),
Matplotlib (Matplotlib License, PSF-based), psutil (BSD-3-Clause): used as installed packages, not redistributed.

plyfile (GPL-3.0) is NOT a dependency. When a user has it installed, xclean-maps uses it only as an optional second
parser to check the written splats.ply.

