Data
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

xclean-maps 0.1.0 ships no model weights and no data. A map built with xclean-maps is derived from the user's own
sequence: its licence follows the licence of that data.

GSKY-1 (our learned grey-sky model) is NOT included in this release. If a later release includes it, its notice is:
  GSKY-1 was trained by Necessity Robotics from scratch on (1) TartanAir (W. Wang, D. Zhu, X. Wang, Y. Hu, Y. Qiu,
  C. Wang, Y. Hu, A. Kapoor, S. Scherer, "TartanAir: A Dataset to Push the Limits of Visual SLAM", IROS 2020,
  Carnegie Mellon University AirLab, <https://theairlab.org/tartanair-dataset/>), licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>), and (2) the Rosario Dataset (T. Pire, M. Mujica, J. Civera,
  E. Kofman, IJRR 38(6), 2019; CIFASIS, CONICET-UNR, <https://robot.cifasis-conicet.gov.ar/>), licensed under
  CC BY 4.0. Changes: sky labels were derived from the images; the weights hold no image data. The dataset authors do
  not endorse this work.
